# RAKSHAK-AI – AI-Based Intrusion Detection System

## 📖 Overview

RAKSHAK-AI is an AI-powered Intrusion Detection System (IDS) developed to identify suspicious network activities and potential security threats in real time. The system combines machine learning techniques with a web-based interface to provide efficient threat monitoring, detection, and alert generation.

The project was developed to strengthen skills in cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, web development, and database management while providing a practical solution for network security monitoring.

---

## 🚀 Features

* Real-time intrusion detection
* AI-based threat analysis
* Suspicious activity monitoring
* Automated alert generation
* User-friendly web interface
* Secure data management
* Database integration
* Responsive dashboard

